{"translation":{"id":"BSB","name":"Berean Standard Bible","website":"https://berean.bible/","licenseUrl":"https://berean.bible/","license":{"attribution":"not-required","commercialUse":"allowed","derivatives":"allowed","copyleft":false,"publicDomain":true},"shortName":"BSB","englishName":"Berean Standard Bible","language":"eng","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6cc5238e442b4204b0f617cc5c932bc04f3bae4a0658e6393b0e319653ebe37f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/BSB/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/BSB/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/BSB/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31086,"languageName":"English","languageEnglishName":"English"},"book":{"id":"2JN","name":"2 John","commonName":"2 John","title":"2 John","numberOfChapters":1,"totalNumberOfVerses":13},"chapters":[null,{"numberOfVerses":13,"thisChapterAudioLinks":{"david":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/2JN/1/audio/david.mp3","gilbert":"https://openbible.com/audio/gilbert/BSB_63_2Jn_001_G.mp3","hays":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/2JN/1/audio/hays.mp3","souer":"https://audio.bible.helloao.org/api/BSB/2JN/1/audio/souer.mp3"},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["A Greeting from the Elder"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["The elder,",{"lineBreak":true},"To the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in the truth—and not I alone, but also all who know the truth—"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["because of the truth that abides in us and will be with us forever:"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, will be with us in truth and love."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Walking in the Truth"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["I was overjoyed to find some of your children walking in the truth, just as the Father has commanded us."]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["And now I urge you, dear lady—not as a new commandment to you, but one we have had from the beginning—that we love one another."]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments. This is the very commandment you have heard from the beginning, that you must walk in love."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Beware of Deceivers"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["For many deceivers have gone out into the world, refusing to confess the coming of Jesus Christ in the flesh. Any such person is the deceiver and the antichrist."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["Watch yourselves, so that you do not lose what we have worked for,",{"noteId":0},"but that you may be fully rewarded."]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["Anyone who runs ahead without remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God. Whoever remains in His teaching has both the Father and the Son."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["If anyone comes to you but does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your home or even greet him."]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["Whoever greets such a person shares in his evil deeds."]},{"type":"heading","content":["Conclusion"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not to do so with paper and ink. Instead, I hope to come and speak with you face to face,",{"noteId":1},"so that our joy may be complete."]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["The children of your elect sister send you greetings.",{"noteId":2}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"NE and WH what you have worked for","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":8}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"Literally mouth to mouth","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":12}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"BYZ and TR include Amen.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":13}}]}}]}
